 two non-exhaustive match warnings.\\n\\nIn the `parseExpr` method (around line 71), change:\\n```scala\\n        result = op match {\\n          case Plus  => result + right\\n          case Minus => result - right\\n        }\\n```\\nto:\\n```scala\\n        result = op match {\\n          case Plus  => result + right\\n          case Minus => result - right\\n          case _     => result\\n        }\\n```\\n\\nIn the `parseTerm` method (around line 86), change:\\n```scala\\n        result = op match {\\n          case Star => result * right\\n          case Slash =>\\n            if (right == 0) throw new ArithmeticException(\\\"Division by zero\\\")\\n            result / right\\n        }\\n```\\nto:\\n```scala\\n        result = op match {\\n          case Star => result * right\\n          case Slash =>\\n            if (right == 0) throw new ArithmeticException(\\\"Division by zero\\\")\\n            result / right\\n          case _    => result\\n        }\\n```\\n\\nUse the file_editor tool with command=\\\"str_replace\\\" to make both changes.\", \"subagent_type\": \"general-purpose\", \"security_risk\": \"LOW\"}", "origin": "completion"}, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-d582f74e-5329-4803-a6cd-13b03af9a689", "security_risk": "LOW", "critic_result": null, "summary": "task: {\"description\": \"Fix match warnings in Calc.scala\", \"prompt\": \"Edit the file /Users/ohama/projs/OpenHandsTests/oh-workdir-planning/arm-b/scala-r2/Calc.scala to fix two non-exhaustive match warnings.\\n\\nIn the `parseExpr` method (around line 71), change:\\n```scala\\n        result = op match {\\n          case Plus  => result + right\\n          case Minus => result - right\\n        }\\n```\\nto:\\n```scala\\n        result = op match {\\n          case Plus  => result + right\\n          case Minus => result - right\\n          case _     => result\\n        }\\n```\\n\\nIn the `parseTerm` method (around line 86), change:\\n```scala\\n        result = op match {\\n          case Star => result * right\\n          case Slash =>\\n            if (right == 0) throw new ArithmeticException(\\\"Division by zero\\\")\\n            result / right\\n        }\\n```\\nto:\\n```scala\\n        result = op match {\\n          case Star => result * right\\n          case Slash =>\\n            if (right == 0) throw new ArithmeticException(\\\"Division by zero\\\")\\n            result / right\\n          case _    => result\\n        }\\n```\\n\\nUse the file_editor tool with command=\\\"str_replace\\\" to make both changes.\", \"subagent_type\": \"general-purpose\"}", "kind": "ActionEvent"}
